OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'proud' veteran killed
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a "proud military
OL,7,Fveteran" who died after being hit by a
OL,8,Fcar has paid tribute to him.
OL,10,FTerry Hutchinson, 88, was struck on
OL,11,FStation Road in Swinton at 18:09 GMT on
OL,12,F22 November and was pronounced dead at
OL,13,Fthe scene.
OL,15,FA man in his 30s was arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,17,Fdriving and has been bailed pending
OL,18,Ffurther investigation.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
