OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'proud' veteran killed
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaying tribute to a "much-loved"
OL,7,Fhusband, brother, uncle, dad, grandad
OL,8,Fand great-grandad, his family said:
OL,9,F"Terry was a proud military veteran who
OL,10,Fserved his country with pride."
